+   ./ops/ci/prepare_auditor_bundle.sh /tmp/aegis_hil_audit.tar.gz
+   Optionally sign with KMS: COSIGN_KMS_URI=... ./ops/formal/package_and_sign_formal.sh /tmp/aegis_formal_bundle
