+# Lab RT Validation Quickstart
+
+Prereqs:
+- Robot node accessible via SSH (inventory in ops/robotics/lab/provision_node_inventory.ini).
+- Ansible installed locally.
+- Python deps for jitter_test and exporter installed on robot node.
+
+Steps:
+1. Provision node for RT kernel (operator review required):
+   ./ops/robotics/lab/provision_node_run.sh ./ops/robotics/lab/provision_node_inventory.ini
+
+2. Reboot node into RT kernel as instructed by playbook output.
+
+3. Run lab validation (locally or via SSH to the node):
+   ./ops/robotics/lab/run_lab_validation.sh <node-hostname-or-ip> 1000 5000 0.2
+
+4. Add prometheus scrape config snippet from ops/robotics/lab/prometheus_rt_scrape.yml to your Prometheus.
+
+5. Inspect /tmp/rt_jitter_result.json and Prometheus metrics (rt_loop_p99_seconds).
+
+6. Record evidence: the run writes evidence manifests via ops/sdk/evidence_sdk.
